invariant: INV-14
file: srv_message.c
catches: srv_test
reason: the NewSessionTicket carries an early_data extension, which tells the
  client it may send 0-RTT data under the ticket (RFC 9846 §4.7.1). This
  server takes the first behaviour §4.3.10 allows and discards no early
  data yet, so a client that accepted the grant would have its first
  0-RTT record fail. test/srv_ticket_tests.h compares the whole message
  against bytes written out by hand, with an empty extensions vector.

--- old
    // An empty extensions vector: no early_data, so no 0-RTT.
    wb_u16(&w, 0);
--- new
    // early_data, max_early_data_size 16384.
    wb_u16(&w, 8);
    wb_u16(&w, EXT_EARLY_DATA);
    wb_u16(&w, 4);
    wb_u16(&w, 0);
    wb_u16(&w, 0x4000);
